// CRDS 0.5% withheld from family benefits (Ord. 96-50 art. 14/19).
// Module 02-crds.law of fr.prestations.versement (wave 5).
// Style follows fr.apl.versement (functions + pub relations + strict rules).
// Effective window [@2021-01-01, infinity): programme coverage (D-01),
// though art. 14 IV runs from 1997-01-01.
//
// COVERAGE. Art. 14 II 8° submits "les prestations visees a l'article
// L. 511-1 et au chapitre V du titre V du livre VII ..., a l'exception
// de l'allocation d'education de l'enfant handicape"
// (fr.apl::ORD9650_ART14_ED2020_01). The second limb is the DOM
// chapter V (L. 755-11 "le present chapitre V", fr.pf.af pins): DOM AF
// flows through the covered af_montant_du (pf-af 06-dom), DOM
// allocation logement (L. 755-21, named in art. 14 IV) through
// fr.apl.versement — no separate rule needed. L. 511-1
// (fr.pf.core::CSS_L511_1) lists: PAJE (prime, base, PreParE, CMG),
// AF, CF, AEEH, ASF, ARS, allocation logement (4°, housing package),
// the death lump sum, AJPP. Hence this module withholds CRDS from the
// brut heads of: AF, CF (base/majore/differentiel), ARS
// (base/differentiel), ASF (base/differentiel), PAJE prime/base/PreParE
// awards (composition per L. 531-1, cited on each rule), CMG
// (direct/structure/differentiel), AJPP monthly amount and frais
// complement. Rate 0.5%: "Le taux des contributions instituees par les
// articles 14 a 17 est fixe a 0,5 %"
// (fr.apl::ORD9650_ART19_ED2020_01). The debtor body withholds
// ("precomptee par l'organisme debiteur", art. 14 III). Only due from
// 1997-01-01 for 8° benefits (art. 14 IV) -> effective.
//
// INPUT CONTRACT (exclusivity). Each Retenue rule fires per stated brut
// head; alternative tracks of one benefit (CF base/majore/differentiel,
// ARS base/differentiel, ASF base/differentiel, CMG direct/structure)
// are assumed mutually exclusive upstream. Where upstream montant
// rules co-fire, CRDS is withheld per stated head (garbage-in); no
// in-module guard masks a foreign double-payment
// (B-PV-UPSTREAM-EXCLUSIVITE, README). Complementary by design and
// OUTSIDE this contract: PAJE prime/base/PreParE (L. 531-1
// components that legitimately coincide) and the CMG transitional
// differential (tops up the new-law amount by design, separate
// bearer): per-head withholding there is correct behavior.
//
// NOT COVERED (with reason, not omission):
// - AEEH: explicit exception in art. 14 II 8° -> no rule.
// - AJPA (L. 168-8, Livre I): not a L. 511-1 benefit, so outside
//   art. 14 II 8°; whether it is a "revenu de remplacement" under
//   art. 14 I is not established by pinned bytes -> boundary, no rule.
// - Housing (art. 14 II 7° APL; L. 511-1 4° / L. 542-1 / L. 755-21
//   allocation logement): owned by fr.apl.versement, not duplicated.
// - Death lump sum (L. 511-1 8°): no benefit package -> no brut head.
//
// BOUNDARIES (pinned text silent):
// - Rounding of the withheld CRDS: the housing guide p. 23 rounds down
//   to the centime, but no equivalent is pinned for PF; art. 14 III
//   points to L. 131-1 CSS, whose bytes are not pinned. This draft
//   computes brut x 0.5% exactly, with no rounding.
// - Territory / Saint-Pierre-et-Miquelon: art. 14/19 are silent on
//   territory. Only fr.pf.af publishes a territoire fact, and its
//   enum has no SPM variant. No territory premise in this draft; the
//   SPM carve-out (fr.apl::CGCT_LO6414_1, as used for housing) is left
//   to the lead.
// - CMG part a (cotisations paid to URSSAF, tiers-payant to EAJE):
//   art. 14 covers the prestation as a whole with no part-level
//   exception, so CRDS runs on the totals; whether the fund withholds
//   on the URSSAF-bound part is left to the lead.
// - AF sharing (montant_parent_partage) and ASE splits divide the
//   household total downstream; the assiette here is af_montant_du only.
// - ARS is an annual (rentree) payment, not monthly; CRDS still runs
//   per entitled child.
// - Pinned Ord. 96-50 coverage starts 2019-09-01; CRDS for earlier
//   months is outside the pinned window.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.prestations.versement version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:prestations-versement";


const TauxCRDSPF: Decimal = 0.005 {
    label fr official "taux de la CRDS applicable aux prestations familiales : 0,5 % (ord. 96-50, art. 19)";
    label en unofficial "CRDS rate on family benefits: 0.5% (Ord. 96-50, Art. 19)";
}

function crds_pf_calculee(base: Money) -> Money =
    base * TauxCRDSPF;

// --- Allocations familiales (Personne-keyed household total) ---

pub relation crds_precomptee_af(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "CRDS precomptee sur les allocations familiales dues";
    label en unofficial "CRDS withheld from the family allowances due";
}

pub relation montant_net_crds_af(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(p);
    label fr official "allocations familiales nettes de CRDS, avant arrondis et planchers";
    label en unofficial "family allowances net of CRDS, before rounding and floors";
}

@source(fr.apl::ORD9650_ART14_ED2020_01, fr.apl::ORD9650_ART19_ED2020_01,
    fr.pf.core::CSS_L511_1)
rule RetenueCRDSAF(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, brut: Money) strict {
    effective [@2021-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "la CRDS au taux de 0,5 % est precomptee sur les allocations familiales";
    label en unofficial "CRDS at 0.5% is withheld from family allowances";
    when fr.pf.af::af_montant_du(p, brut);
    then crds_precomptee_af(p, crds_pf_calculee(brut));
}

@source(fr.apl::ORD9650_ART14_ED2020_01)
rule NetApresCRDSAF(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, brut: Money, crds: Money) strict {
    effective [@2021-01-01, infinity);
    label fr official "les allocations nettes sont le brut diminue de la CRDS precomptee";
    label en unofficial "net allowances are gross minus withheld CRDS";
    when fr.pf.af::af_montant_du(p, brut) and crds_precomptee_af(p, crds);
    then montant_net_crds_af(p, brut - crds);
}

